        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In Peru, we are members of Peru Sostenible, the country’s largest network promoting sustainable development, and Es Hoy, a movement of business leaders committed to an inclusive, prosperous, and sustainable Peru.",
        "start_character": 42054,
        "end_character": 42266
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001001290-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001001290-26-000008-d41e8cdc1525cec6",
        "accession_number": "0001001290-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The results have been impressive across all 3 target dimensions: we have 62% fewer service incidents (compared to 2021) with 99.8% uptime, we released 4x the number of features (compared to 2021), development time has been reduced by 75% (compared to 2021) and we have reduced the unit transaction cost by 82% (compared to 2021).",
        "start_character": 67875,
        "end_character": 68204
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001001290-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001001290-26-000008-d41e8cdc1525cec6",
        "accession_number": "0001001290-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To support the operational risk management process, we have developed a Business Continuity Management (BCM) discipline, which involves the implementation of continuity plans for critical business processes,",
        "start_character": 289339,
        "end_character": 289546
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001001290-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001001290-26-000008-d41e8cdc1525cec6",
        "accession_number": "0001001290-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to foster a strong Occupational Health and Safety culture in the countries where we operate, convinced that investing in people’s care is essential to business continuity and to building a solid, balanced, and sustainable future.",
        "start_character": 170798,
        "end_character": 171039
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001001290-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001001290-26-000008-d41e8cdc1525cec6",
        "accession_number": "0001001290-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With operations in 6 countries, we are consolidating our leadership position through four main business units: Asset Management, Wealth Management, Capital Markets, and Trust Services.",
        "start_character": 141572,
        "end_character": 141756
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001001290-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001001290-26-000008-d41e8cdc1525cec6",
        "accession_number": "0001001290-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "however, for more mass-market products, we believe there is room for growth, provided that we strengthen our distribution processes, considering that we operate in a market with limited size.",
        "start_character": 219468,
        "end_character": 219659
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001001290-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001001290-26-000008-d41e8cdc1525cec6",
        "accession_number": "0001001290-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•For Individuals, we developed a different strategy for each subsegment: from the Affluent where we have a value proposition based on personalized digital and physical comprehensive service, to a more digital cost-efficient and transactional value proposition that aim to expand the credit access through innovative digital solutions like Yape for the mass market.",
        "start_character": 65971,
        "end_character": 66335
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001001290-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001001290-26-000008-d41e8cdc1525cec6",
        "accession_number": "0001001290-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•To boost sales and enhance customer protection, we aim to develop new products, establish additional distribution channels, and leverage our Credicorp channels.",
        "start_character": 132037,
        "end_character": 132198
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001001290-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001001290-26-000008-d41e8cdc1525cec6",
        "accession_number": "0001001290-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "29733, as well as other relevant regulations in the countries where we operate.",
        "start_character": 167442,
        "end_character": 167521
      },
      {
